  topic: 0
  title: Good Luck!
  body: Welcome to your first mission. Move with {Move Up}, {Move Left}, {Move Down},
    {Move Right}, or left-click where you want to go. Find the objectives, avoid
    the guards and reach the exit! The full controls are in the pause menu, which
    can be opened with {Pause} or by left-clicking the top-right button.
